<title>USA: Valero energy says acquisition on schedule.</title>
<headline>Valero energy says acquisition on schedule.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valero Energy Corporation said on Wednesday that it signed a definitive agreement to acquire Basis Petroleum, Inc. (Basis), a wholly owned subsidiary of Salomon Inc.</p>
<p>Valero said on March 17 that it intended to buy Basis for $285 million plus approximately $200 million in inventories.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition process remains on schedule and Valero expects to complete the purchase of Basis on May 1 of this year,&quot; Valero said in a statement Wednesday.</p>
</text>
